# C-17 check: total tangential force vs Coulomb limit (tests/tangential, LIGGGHTS modernization branch, audit B1)
# Two overlapping spheres at fixed positions (no integrator), strongly damped (e = 0.1),
# driven with a constant relative tangential velocity: |Ft| must not exceed mu*|Fn| with coulomb_total on.
hard_particles yes
atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region domain block -0.004 0.004 -0.004 0.004 -0.004 0.004 units box
create_box 1 domain
neighbor 0.0002 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 1e7
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.1
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.3
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history ${opts}
pair_coeff * *
timestep 1e-6
create_atoms 1 single -0.00099 0 0 units box
create_atoms 1 single  0.00099 0 0 units box
set atom * diameter 0.002 density 2500
set atom 1 vy  0.05
set atom 2 vy -0.05
variable st equal step
variable fx equal fx[1]
variable fy equal fy[1]
variable fz equal fz[1]
fix pr all print 1 "${st} ${fx} ${fy} ${fz}" file traj.txt screen no title "# step fx fy fz"
thermo 1000000
run 80
